  "analysis": "I confirmed the VM implements syscalls for read/write/open/close and file operations, which doomgeneric_img.c needs for BMP output and printf. I still need to see ELF loading and instruction dispatch. The memory model is little-endian, so I will likely need mipsel. Next I will inspect the ELF loader and main entry, then install the cross-compiler.",
